### Pago programático: Circuit Breaker observa el request lógico
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/programmatic?composition=PER_REQUEST&isolation=SEMAPHORE
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-payment-001

{
  "merchantId": "merchant-demo",
  "amount": 149.90,
  "currency": "PEN"
}

### Pago programático: Circuit Breaker observa cada intento
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/programmatic?composition=PER_ATTEMPT&isolation=SEMAPHORE
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-payment-002

{
  "merchantId": "merchant-demo",
  "amount": 99.90,
  "currency": "PEN"
}

